/vyact-evergreen-cards-library.json

# ─── WhatsApp / Ask Vyact design decks ───────────────────────
# The two HTML decks + templates.css ARE committed — they are the cited source
# of truth for `whatsapp-vyact-solutioning.md` §2 and
# `vyact-ask-vyact-responses-spec.md`. Their binaries are not: 11 unoptimised
# ~600 KB PNG previews, the delivery zip, and loose screenshots ≈ 15 MB.
# Binaries are easy to add later; they are not easy to remove from history.
WhatsApp & Ask Vyact Message Templates/*.jpg
WhatsApp & Ask Vyact Message Templates/*.zip
WhatsApp & Ask Vyact Message Templates/Vyact/vyact-templates/media/

# Lane B (cloud e2e) run artefacts — traces and reports, never committed
react/e2e/.results-lane-b/
react/playwright-report-lane-b/
